# MEGS authoring (MEGS-0007)

- Use MUST / SHOULD / MAY consistently; avoid vague “maybe” norms.
- Bump the spec `Version` on every normative edit (MAJOR/MINOR/PATCH per `docs/megs/README.md`).
- MUST NOT land silent breaking changes; add a migration note when MUST rules change.
- Keep examples non-normative unless labeled as requirements.
- Cross-link related MEGS ids instead of duplicating large sections.
